---
// Owner-only OAuth landing page: Pinterest redirects here with ?code=… after
// the one-time app authorization. Shows the code + exactly what to do with it
// (paste into the "Pinterest 연결" GitHub Actions run). Noindexed — this page
// means nothing to readers.
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Pinterest 연결"
  description="Pinterest OAuth callback."
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="cb">
    <h1>📌 Pinterest 연결 코드</h1>
    <p id="status">주소에서 코드를 읽는 중…</p>
    <div id="ok" hidden>
      <p>아래 코드를 복사한 뒤, <strong>몇 분 안에</strong>(코드가 곧 만료돼요) GitHub Actions에서 붙여넣어 실행하세요.</p>
      <div class="code-row">
        <code id="code"></code>
        <button id="copy" type="button">복사</button>
      </div>
      <ol>
        <li>아래 버튼으로 GitHub Actions의 <strong>「Pinterest 연결 (최초 1회)」</strong> 페이지 열기</li>
        <li>오른쪽의 <strong>Run workflow</strong> 버튼 클릭</li>
        <li><strong>code</strong> 칸에 위 코드를 붙여넣고 초록색 <strong>Run workflow</strong> 클릭</li>
        <li>1~2분 뒤 텔레그램으로 "연결 완료" 알림이 오면 끝!</li>
      </ol>
      <p>
        <a
          class="btn"
          href="https://github.com/pixer-11/korea-travel-guide/actions/workflows/pinterest-auth.yml"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
        >GitHub Actions 열기 →</a>
      </p>
    </div>
    <p id="err" hidden>
      코드가 없습니다. Pinterest 인증 링크를 통해 다시 들어와 주세요.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  const params = new URLSearchParams(location.search);
  const code = params.get('code');
  const status = document.getElementById('status')!;
  if (code) {
    status.hidden = true;
    document.getElementById('ok')!.hidden = false;
    document.getElementById('code')!.textContent = code;
    document.getElementById('copy')!.addEventListener('click', async (e) => {
      await navigator.clipboard.writeText(code);
      (e.target as HTMLButtonElement).textContent = '복사됨 ✓';
    });
  } else {
    status.hidden = true;
    document.getElementById('err')!.hidden = false;
  }
</script>

<style>
  .cb { max-width: 640px; margin: 3rem auto; padding: 0 1.25rem; }
  .cb h1 { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .code-row { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; align-items: center; margin: 1rem 0; }
  .code-row code {
    flex: 1; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; border: 1px solid #d8d2c4; border-radius: 8px;
    background: #faf7f0; word-break: break-all; font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .code-row button, .btn {
    padding: 0.6rem 1.1rem; border-radius: 8px; border: none; cursor: pointer;
    background: #c8443a; color: #fff; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .cb ol { margin: 1rem 0 1.25rem; padding-left: 1.4rem; line-height: 1.9; }
</style>
